{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18side_level_act18side_01_beg","groupId":"act18side","stageId":"act18side_01","title":"閒聊波爾卡","storyCode":"LE-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"66a98d699ec2cf81dc2be6e1d23bb51dd502d45e4a1e442e2db33eb3115366c2","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"黑鍵與白堊的演奏並未得到車爾尼的青睞。為此，黑鍵前去拜訪音樂會的贊助人格特魯德，得知了她籌備已久的計畫。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g11_lounge"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我遲到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是選拔賽！你再晚個二十分鐘，我們倆就可以手牽手打道回府了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就不為自己辯解一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實是......早上的時候，爺爺不見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不見了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也不是什麼大事，我在夕照區的巷子裡找到了爺爺，爺爺說他只是醒得太早，出去散步了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直散步，直到你來之前？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有沒有，我們今早還去羅德島辦了住院手續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你爺爺？去羅德島辦事處住院？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得羅德島在維謝海姆只有個小辦事處，根本不能收住院病人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本是不能的，但芙蓉特意把自己的床騰了出來，還向我保證，一定把爺爺的健康放在第一位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......說得好聽，實際上要了你不少錢吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你昨天給我的錢，今早他們只收了一半還不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，那你可得時常去看看你爺爺，免得他們在你看不到的地方節省經費。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“節省經費”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們畢竟是商業公司，用這麼低的價格收治病人，利潤當然還得從病人身上來。比如說，伙食上克扣一點，器材和藥品上克扣一點——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得不會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知道不會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天下午，我還沒交錢，他們就給爺爺發了口服藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天早上芙蓉還留我吃飯，我因為沒時間才拒絕了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼刻意的表演，恐怕連你爺爺都看出來了，他才不想去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，我會時常去看爺爺的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是怕我和爺爺吃虧才特意跟我說這些，我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，不說這個了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天拿到譜子之後，你看得怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禮貌的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下一組，黑鍵和白堊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的選拔賽可是車爾尼親自坐鎮，我們可不能丟人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g10_stage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，車爾尼先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必寒暄，開始吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"和觀眾席上擠滿圍觀群眾的報名會不同，選拔賽上，除了車爾尼和參加選拔的人們，只有寥寥幾名工作人員。\n如果昨天那些觀眾在場，他們多半會為這段短短的合奏拍紅手掌。\n但此時此刻，最後的餘音已經散去，車爾尼的臉色卻並不好看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g10_stage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車爾尼先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們沒怎麼練過吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如您所說，但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臨時拼湊的感覺太重，你吹你的，他拉他的，幾乎感覺不到配合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是你，完全不管大提琴旋律段的情感表達，一直在自己的速度上，反而要大提琴遷就你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是你後來反應過來，這一段就徹底被你搞砸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"徹底被我搞砸了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我覺得您可能聽得不是很真切......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就坐在這，你說我聽得不真切？你覺得我聽力有問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車爾尼先生，黑鍵不是那個意思，他只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是什麼？我看只是被人捧習慣了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被人捧習慣了？！您完全不瞭解我的處境，我要求您收回——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）黑鍵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊可以再考慮，你就算了。下一組。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼，我難道連他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——車爾尼先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果黑鍵不能登場，那我也沒辦法參加音樂會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你何必幫他說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵幫了我很多忙，所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，這場音樂會少一個大提琴手也不會怎樣，少一個來湊熱鬧的貴族老爺，我更是求之不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一組！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g7_concerthall_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個混蛋，他以為他是誰？不就是會彈兩下鋼琴，會作兩首曲子嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你別激動啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼能不激動？他那是什麼態度？還“捧習慣了”，我長這麼大，誰捧過我，我被誰捧了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得剛剛你們只是起了一點誤會，車爾尼先生未必覺得我們有那麼糟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當然不糟了，糟的是我！忘了他說什麼了？“白堊可以再考慮，你就算了”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得還是早點跟車爾尼先生道歉比較好，他說不定會讓我們再試一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辦法總會有的，沒必要跟他這麼低聲下氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，除了道歉，我也想不出別的辦法了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之你先回家吧，我也回住處想想該怎麼辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是真沒辦法，我們再去找車爾尼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g1_gorgeousstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“捧習慣了”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個音樂家什麼都不懂，也敢胡說八道......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（又是頭痛......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憑空出現的聲音","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒用的假貨......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憑空出現的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"連身染惡疾的下賤平民都厭惡你俗不可耐的笛聲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我閉嘴！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位大人，雖然我們素不相識，不過您似乎需要一些幫助？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒這個必要，多謝費心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（居然是那個人的——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......恕我失禮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反倒是您，身體不舒服嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你——您說什麼？沒有，沒有的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？我看您的臉色也不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，哈哈，哈哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_493_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失禮了，失禮了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的頭痛又發作了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，已經沒什麼感覺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼突然向我道歉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓您在今天的選拔賽上感到窘迫，甚至還引發了頭痛，是我考慮不周。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是您考慮不周？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您怎麼知道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，您當然應該知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實，我好歹也是這場音樂會的贊助人之一，音樂會上的事很快就會傳進我的耳朵裡，黑鍵先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必擔心，這不算什麼大事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事實上，我聽說車爾尼對你們的評價並不低，他是有心把你們當作《晨暮》的備選的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和他多少有些交情，對他也算了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他畢竟是個還算知名的藝術家，又是個感染者，脾氣大了些，還請您包涵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對這場音樂會還是有一點話語權的，您和白堊安心練習就好，車爾尼的工作由我來做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，與其勞煩您動用話語權，我還是更想讓選拔賽重來一次。上午只是發揮失常而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，您也不必太過糾結此事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要喝茶嗎？今天準備的是柑橘調味的紅茶，據說對頭痛有些好處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勞您費心了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茶很香，多謝您的款待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，接下來的話，請您聽好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正如您之前所料，我之所以邀請您來維謝海姆，到感染者聚居區來參加一場音樂會，確有別的用意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看起來不是很驚訝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經習慣被人利用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您沒有別的用意，我可能還更驚訝一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，我就直言相告了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一個籌備已久的計畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您按照計畫行事，我有很大把握讓您擺脫“塵世之音”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——您說什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塵世之音，黑鍵先生，您諸多不幸的根源，您獲封烏提卡伯爵的法理依據之一，那位——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要您向我解釋什麼是塵世之音，畢竟那玩意兒一直在我的腦子裡，時不時就會出來折磨我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要您說明的是計畫的具體內容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很簡單，只需要您和剛剛認識的白堊先生在車爾尼先生的音樂會上合奏，這就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我出於最大的善意，把這當成一個玩笑，格特魯德女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這絕不是什麼玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和您一樣，白堊身上同樣寄宿有塵世之音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他？塵世之音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雙子女皇明確說過，塵世之音只剩我身上這一段了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這只能說明，她們也有不知道的事情，而且這樣的事情並不少見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要在空間上足夠接近，兩段塵世之音就會發生“共振”，而這種共振會同時強化雙方的法術，這是我計畫的基礎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了能強化你們的法術，共振本身也是一種強大的能量，而這種能量會在你們兩個合奏時大大加強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要合理誘導，我就能利用共振的能量，把您的那段塵世之音轉移到他的身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那白堊會怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必擔心，我會以合適的方式處理的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是不明白，為什麼非要是車爾尼的音樂會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就在白堊的家裡跟他合奏，您來誘導共振，把我的塵世之音轉移給他，不行嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"共振的誘導是一門精妙的藝術，要是沒有夕照廳，單憑我自己是做不到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夕照廳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您還不知道嗎？夕照廳是在巫王陛下的監督之下建造完工的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒聽說過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為巫王陛下在統治末期下令興建的建築，夕照廳使用的建材與結構和陛下的高塔有諸多相似之處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它本不應是一座與感染者聚居區同名的音樂廳，而應該是一座法術要塞，一場讓陛下的敵人們魂飛魄散的噩夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然這已經是僭越，但我的確需要夕照廳來輔助我引導共振的能量，最終除去寄宿於您體內的塵世之音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於計畫的具體內容，您還有別的問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事成之後，白堊和其餘的瑣事由我來處理，您只要適當地躲藏一段時間就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到風頭過去，您就可以徹底擺脫令人難堪的貴族身份，成為一名自由的平民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，如果您不願接受這唾手可得的自由，我也不會強迫您，更不會因為您知曉了計畫的內容就對您不利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管您是想在維謝海姆待到音樂會結束，還是要立刻返回烏提卡，我都不會阻攔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會阻攔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是頭一個想去除，而不是利用我身上塵世之音的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您到底想從我身上得到什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個強援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"強援？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不過是個傀儡伯爵，甚至不能親自打理封地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您所謂的計畫成功之後，我只會成為一個身份不明的平民，談何強援？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"封地、軍隊，甚至源石技藝......這些都不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重要的是，烏提卡伯爵失蹤了，甚至被宣告死亡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想想看，在合適的時機，烏提卡伯爵死而復生，萊塔尼亞的輿論會作何反應？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“死而復生”，這就是您能對我提供的最大的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請......給我一些時間和獨處的機會，格特魯德女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樂意之至。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想去什麼地方，請儘管跟外面的僕人吩咐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......再見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見，希望您能做出最符合自身利益的決定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聽好，白堊和羅德島的接觸需要密切關注。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"必要時，允許你干擾羅德島的行動，但切記不要打草驚蛇，禁止直接武力衝突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於烏提卡伯爵的情況，請容我向您報告......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不必囉嗦，我們知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是你自己的計畫，如果這點小事都要一件一件報告，我們乾脆給你派一位貼身指導，如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，是我考慮不周。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵的事倒是好辦，可白堊和羅德島......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都忘了，還有現成的素材呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
